Beast-type → +2 (DMG +8, WS damage +10%); 2817 150 Aquan-type → +3 (DMG +9, WS damage +10%); 3280 150 Amorph-type → Kauriraris (DMG +7, Weapon skill damage +10%, Weapon skill damage +11%, Double Attack +6%).\n• TP path: 250 weapon skills of at least 400 damage each, using any of Hard Slash, Power Slash, Frostbite, Freezebite, Shockwave, Crescent Moon, Sickle Moon, Spinning Slash, Ground Strike, Scourge, Herculean Slash, Torcleaver, Resolution, Dimidiation, Fimbulvetr.\n• 2385 on Undead-type → +2 TP Bonus; 2818 on Bird-type → +3 TP Bonus; 3281 on Beast-type → Kauriraris (TP Bonus, Weapon skill damage +11%, Double Attack +6%, Store TP +9).' } } },
