WS damage +10%); 2953 150 Undead-type → +3 (DMG +2, WS damage +10%); 3416 150 Arcana-type → Hitaki (DMG +2, Weapon skill damage +10%, Weapon skill damage +11%, Double Attack +6%).\n• TP path: 250 weapon skills of at least 400 damage each, using any of Blade: Rin, Blade: Retsu, Blade: Teki, Blade: To, Blade: Chi, Blade: Ei, Blade: Jin, Blade: Ten, Blade: Ku, Blade: Metsu, Blade: Kamu, Blade: Yu, Blade: Hi, Blade: Shun, Zesho Meppo.\n• 2521 on Demon-type → +2 TP Bonus; 2954 on Lizard-type → +3 TP Bonus; 3417 on Vermin-type → Hitaki (TP Bonus, Weapon skill damage +11%, Double Attack +6%, Store TP +9).' } } },
