    { name = 'Guide: Magian trials: Polearm', group = 'Server', desc = 'Polearm Magian trial chains on this server, with each trial\'s number, required weapon, objective, reward and follow-up trials. Source: https://vanadreams.org/wiki/#guide-c_magian_trials_polearm', steps = { { title = 'Overview', note = '• Trials are started and rewarded by the Magian Moogle (orange, weapons) in Ru\'Lude Gardens; delivery items go in the Delivery Crate beside it.\n• Bring the exact weapon shown (with exactly those augments), accept the trial, complete the objective with it equipped, then return it to the Moogle for the upgrade.\n• Counts listed are this server\'s: half of standard.\n• Format below: trial: weapon in → weapon out: objective; next trials.\n• See the Magian trials guide for kill/delivery rules and bonus augments on finished weapons.' }, { title = 'Ranseur line (starts at trial 430)', note = '• Begins with a plain Ranseur; also produces Bradamante, Corsesca, Corsesca +1/+2/+3 and Chauve-Souris (later rows cut off in source).\n• Lines that reach an Empyrean weapon continue in Empyrean weapons: Magian trials.\n• 430: Ranseur → Copperhead: kill Slendlix Spindlethumb (Inner Horutoto Ruins) x2; next 431.\n• 431: → Copperhead (Attack +3): kill Herbage Hunter (Tahrongi Canyon) x2; next 432.\n• 432: → Copperhead (Attack +5): kill Kirata (Beaucedine Glacier) x2; next 433 or 438.\n• 433: → Oathkeeper: kill Intulo (Bibiki Bay) x2; next 434.\n• 434: → Oathkeeper (Attack +3): kill Ramponneau (West Sarutabaruta [S]) x2; next 435.\n• 435: → Oathkeeper (Attack +5): kill Keeper of Halidom (The Sanctuary of ZiTah) x2; next 436.\n• 436: → Oathkeeper (Attack +7): kill Shoggoth x3 (North Gustaberg, Pashhow Marshlands, or either\'s [S]); next 437.\n• 437: → Oathkeeper (DMG +12): kill Farruca Fly x3 (Meriphataud Mountains, West Sarutabaruta, or either\'s [S]); next 1400.\n• 1400: → Oathkeeper (DMG +14): kill Chesma x4 (Konschtat Highlands, La Theine Plateau or Tahrongi Canyon); next 1401 or 1402.\n• 1401: → Rhongomiant: deliver 25 Two-leaf Chloris Bud; continues at 2063 (Empyrean).\n• 1402: → Cerastes: deliver 8 Coin of Advancement; next 2064.\n• 2064: → Cerastes +1: deliver 8 Beastmen\'s Seal; next 2468.\n• 2468: → Cerastes +2: deliver 10 Kindred\'s Seal; next 2901.\n• 2901: → Cerastes +3: deliver 18 Devious Die; next 3364.\n• 3364: → Daboya (Weapon skill damage +11%, Double Attack +6%, Store TP +9, Critical hit rate +6%): deliver 18 Liminal Residue; end.\n• 438: Copperhead (Attack +5) → Bradamante: kill 200 Lizard-type; next 439.\n• 439: → Bradamante (Delay -6): kill 150 Puk family; next 440 or 441.' }, { title = 'Ranseur line (starts at trial 444)', note = '• Begins with a plain Ranseur; produces Stribog, Langdebeve, Langdebeve +1/+2/+3 and Nahvalr.\n• 444: Ranseur → Stribog: kill 25 Bird family (1 point each, 6 in any elemental weather); next 445 or 478.\n• 445: → Stribog (Fire, Wind, Thunder and Light resistance +5): kill 25 Scorpion family; only counts on Firesday/Windsday/Lightningday/Lightsday (1) or in Fire/Wind/Thunder/Light weather (5, or 6 if the day matches); next 446, 454, 462 or 470.\n• From 446 to 2068, kills count only on Firesday (1) or in Fire weather (5, or 6 on Firesday).\n• 446: → Stribog (Fire resistance +10, Additional effect: Fire damage): kill 25 of any monster; next 447.\n• 447: → Stribog (STR +1, Additional effect: Fire damage): kill 38 Aquan-type; next 448, 450 or 452.\n• 448: → Stribog (DMG +16, Delay -12, STR +2, Attack +8): kill 50 Beast-type; next 449.\n• 449: → Stribog (DMG +21, Delay -12, STR +4, Attack +15): kill 100 Flan family; next 1408.\n• 1408: → Stribog (DMG +23, Delay -12, STR +4, Attack +15): kill 100 Vermin-type; next 1409.\n• 1409: → Langdebeve (STR +6, Attack +20): kill 125 Manticore family; next 2068.\n• 2068: → Langdebeve +1 (STR +8, Attack +22): kill 150 Bird-type; next 2472.\n• 2472: → Langdebeve +2 (STR +9, Attack +24): deliver 8 Flame Geode; next 2905.\n• 2905: → Langdebeve +3 (STR +10, Attack +24): deliver 20 Flame Geode; next 3368.' }, { title = 'Stingray line (starts at trial 1457)', note = '• Begins with a plain Stingray; produces Stingray +1/+2/+3 and Sixgill.\n• 1457: Stingray → Stingray (DMG +3, Leg Sweep damage +10%): use Leg Sweep 50 times; next 1458.\n• 1458: → Stingray (DMG +8, Vorpal Thrust damage +10%): use Vorpal Thrust 100 times; next 1459.\n• 1459: → Stingray (DMG +12, Skewer damage +10%): use Skewer 150 times on Bird-type; next 1460 or 1461.\n• 1460: → Stingray (DMG +18, Impulse Drive damage +10%): use Impulse Drive 250 times on Plantoid-type; next 2092.\n• 2092: → Stingray +1 (Weapon skill damage +10%): kill 150 Vermin-type; next 2496 or 2497.\n• 2496: → Stingray +2 (DMG +7, Weapon skill damage +10%): kill 150 Lizard-type; next 2929.\n• 2929: → Stingray +3 (DMG +6, Weapon skill damage +10%): kill 150 Arcana-type; next 3392.\n• 3392: → Sixgill (DMG +7, Weapon skill damage +10%, Weapon skill damage +11%, Double Attack +6%): kill 150 Undead-type; end.\n• TP Bonus branch: any of Double Thrust, Thunder Thrust, Raiden Thrust, Leg Sweep, Penta Thrust, Vorpal Thrust, Skewer, Wheeling Thrust, Impulse Drive, Geirskogul, Drakesbane, Sonic Thrust, Camlann\'s Torment, Stardiver, Diarmuid counts; each must deal 400+ damage.\n• 2497: Stingray +1 (Weapon skill damage +10%) → Stingray +2 (TP Bonus): 250 such weapon skills on Amorph-type; next 2930.\n• 2930: → Stingray +3 (TP Bonus): 250 on Beast-type; next 3393.\n• 3393: → Sixgill (TP Bonus, Weapon skill damage +11%, Double Attack +6%, Store TP +9): 250 on Aquan-type; end.' } } },
